WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Your rules. Your swarm.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:08.000
IF free planet → conquer

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Capture planets.
Grow your swarm.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Goal: the most particles
at the end of the match.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Set your priorities.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.000
IF stronger enemy → retreat

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Watch your rules in action.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.000
But the battle changes…

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Take control at the right moment.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:46.000
One order. A new course.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.000
G: back to gambits.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Later: the planet changes hands.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Discover Botters.
